## 📚 Usage

### Training Pipeline

```python
from src.posture_detection.main import run_pipeline

# Run complete pipeline
run_pipeline(records=5000)
```

### Making Predictions

#### Single Prediction
```python
from src.posture_detection.predict import predict_posture

record = {
    "spine_x": 0.2,
    "spine_y": -0.4,
    "spine_z": 0.7,
    "neck_x": 1.0,
    "neck_y": 0.3,
    "neck_z": 0.5,
    "head_tilt": 1.2,
}

prediction = predict_posture(record)
print(f"Predicted posture: {prediction}")  # "Good Posture"
```

#### Batch Predictions with Confidence
```python
from src.posture_detection.predict import (
    predict_posture_batch,
    predict_with_confidence
)

# With confidence scores
prediction, confidence = predict_with_confidence(record)
print(f"{prediction} (confidence: {confidence:.2%})")

# Batch processing
records = [record1, record2, record3]
predictions, processing_time = predict_posture_batch(records)
print(f"Processed {len(predictions)} records in {processing_time:.3f}s")
```

