## 🏗️ Architecture

### Data Flow

```
Raw Telemetry Data
    ↓
Data Generator (synthetic)
    ↓
Raw CSV Files (data/raw/)
    ↓
ETL Pipeline
  - Validation
  - Cleaning
  - Feature Engineering
    ↓
Processed CSV (data/processed/)
    ↓
Model Training
  - Train-Test Split
  - Random Forest Classifier
  - Evaluation
    ↓
Trained Model (models/)
    ↓
REST API
  - FastAPI
  - Async Support
  - Batch Processing
    ↓
Predictions
```

### Component Responsibilities

| Component | Purpose |
|-----------|---------|
| `config.py` | Centralized configuration management |
| `data_generator.py` | Synthetic skeletal data creation |
| `etl.py` | Data validation, cleaning, feature engineering |
| `train.py` | Model training and evaluation |
| `predict.py` | Inference functions |
| `api.py` | REST API with FastAPI |
| `exceptions.py` | Custom error types |
| `logger.py` | Structured logging |
| `schemas.py` | Pydantic validation models |

