## 📊 Posture Classes

| Class | Description | Example |
|-------|-------------|---------|
| **Good Posture** (0) | Head aligned with shoulders, straight spine | shoulders back, chin level |
| **Slouched** (1) | Rounded shoulders, forward head | hunched back |
| **Forward Head** (2) | Head moved forward, neck strain | text neck, computer work |

## 🔍 Model Performance

### Training Metrics

The default model achieves:
- **Accuracy**: ~92-95% (varies with dataset)
- **Macro F1 Score**: ~91-94%
- **Class-wise Performance**: Balanced across all three classes

### Hyperparameters

```python
